-- ね, よ, 〜のです, まで (time), から (from) and など.
--
-- The first batch since the tokeniser learned to read grammar patterns, and it
-- shows: all forty sentences passed `check:examples` on the first attempt,
-- where earlier batches needed two or three rewrites each to work around です
-- and its relatives shredding.
--
-- Additive, idempotent, safe on a live database.

